{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_100_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "73f6dde80de9113646b31c94b3a0c7b8e0c53ae526ad6e0db05b386dfaff6c91", "ja": "わぁ、うれしいな……ありがとうございます！\nぜひ来てくださいね！", "zh": "哇，好开心……谢谢您！\n请一定要再来哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_100_1012_fun2", "source_sha256": "2f16390b92696839329dabfc640a15c97a9c6c30eb169950bd97651fc92938a7", "ja": "は、春香ちゃん！　今日の公演、ビックリしました！\nすごくセクシーで、か、カッコ良くて……！", "zh": "春、春香！今天的演出真让我大吃一惊！\n特别性感，而且、而且还很帅气……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_100_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "4e22f2537f062b27793e6024ac9064a5011b726c527efb98ddf7b11584cc2613", "ja": "ありがとう！　今日は、カッコいいところも\n見せたいって思ってたから、うれしいな♪", "zh": "谢谢你！因为我今天也想展现出\n帅气的一面，能听到你这么说真开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
