{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_100_1021_005yay", "source_sha256": "71642223853bca963bb3d253cef7fcd341a97ca9f4420172232bace2b9574804", "ja": "あっ、そうかも？\nだって今日の春香さん、すごかったですから！", "zh": "啊，说不定真的是这样？\n因为今天的春香小姐，真的太厉害了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_100_1022_005yay", "source_sha256": "e9b002225ca1c61974ea256198ba08e1f92e84524d0aef58da6d6482c096b707", "ja": "すっごくカワイイのに、カッコよくて。だから\nお客さんの言ってること全部、正解ですよね！", "zh": "明明特别可爱，却又很帅气。所以  \n观众说的全都对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
